application  choupoSolve;

//  AUDIENCE.  A SHOWCASE composes engineering (bin/curate/check_case_tiers):
//  a three-bed converter, two recycle cuts, refrigerated separation and a
//  scrubber with its own property package are not a feature being isolated
//  (a witness) -- they are a plant, and the base case a design-project group
//  starts from.
tier         showcase;
description  "Ammonia, 1200 t/day: the REFERENCE case of the PEQ 2026-27 project brief (base data v2), outside the ammonia numbering. Its detail differs from equipment to equipment (a three-bed converter sized by its kinetics beside exchangers designed by Kern); ammoniaPEQ02 and 03 are earlier design stages of the same project. Electrolytic H2 at 30 bar and ASU nitrogen (99.99 % N2, 100 ppm Ar) at 8 bar; nitrogen booster and two-stage intercooled make-up compression to 150 bar; a synthesis loop with a feed/effluent exchanger, three adiabatic catalyst beds on the Dyson-Simon rate times the effectiveness factor, their volumes solved against stated criteria, with two interbed steam boilers in one pressure shell, cooling to 40 C and -20 C and separation at 140 bar; purge; two-stage let-down to storage at 1 atm. Seventeen units, each in its own folder, the converter a sector of five. SRK vapour; H2, N2 and Ar dissolved in liquid ammonia through measured Henry constants.";
verbosity    3;

